_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a> in dialogue.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by traders, found in containers, and carried by enemies</li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203102\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2551/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40152/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7787/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1200554/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   62.092      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   62.092      1 -total\n 44.41%   27.576     11 Template:Icon_text\n 38.89%   24.146     27 Template:Trim\n 17.36%   10.781      3 Template:Uid\n 16.07%    9.976      1 Template:Condition\n 13.32%    8.272      4 Template:Icon_link\n 11.17%    6.938      1 Template:Main_only\n  9.36%    5.813      3 Template:Template_style\n  9.09%    5.645      1 Template:Condition_full/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:13780-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203102 and revision id 378961. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}